{
    "title": "Walker Watch Face",
    "description": "The \"Walker\" watch face seamlessly combines the modern aesthetic of a digital display with the timeless elegance of traditional watch hands, offering a unique fusion of technology and classic style. \r\n\r\nThis watch face is free with limited functions. Unlocking the Premium version you get all great features. \r\n\r\n#smartwatch #wearOS #watchface  #free #premium\r\n\r\n<b>This watch face supports only Wear OS by Google.</b>\r\n<b>NOT SUPPORTED: Samsung S2/S3/Watch on Tizen OS, Huawei Watch GT/GT2, Xiaomi Amazfit GTS, Xiaomi Pace, Xiaomi Bip, and other watches. </b>\r\n\r\nQ: Do your watch faces support Samsung Active 4 and Samsung Active 4 Classic?\r\nA: <b>Yes, our watch faces support Wear OS smartwatches.</b>\r\n\r\nQ: I bought the app on my phone, do I have to buy it again for my watch?\r\nA: <b>You should not have to buy it again. Sometimes the Play Store takes a bit longer to figure out that you already bought the app. Any additional order will automatically be refunded by Google, you will receive the money back.</b>\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605 DISCLAIMER:  \u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>Other FAQ find here:</b>\r\nhttps://richface.watch/faq\r\n\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "The &quot;Walker&quot; watch face seamlessly combines the modern aesthetic of a digital display with the timeless elegance of traditional watch hands, offering a unique fusion of technology and classic style. <br><br>This watch face is free with limited functions. Unlocking the Premium version you get all great features. <br><br>#smartwatch #wearOS #watchface  #free #premium<br><br><b>This watch face supports only Wear OS by Google.</b><br><b>NOT SUPPORTED: Samsung S2/S3/Watch on Tizen OS, Huawei Watch GT/GT2, Xiaomi Amazfit GTS, Xiaomi Pace, Xiaomi Bip, and other watches. </b><br><br>Q: Do your watch faces support Samsung Active 4 and Samsung Active 4 Classic?<br>A: <b>Yes, our watch faces support Wear OS smartwatches.</b><br><br>Q: I bought the app on my phone, do I have to buy it again for my watch?<br>A: <b>You should not have to buy it again. Sometimes the Play Store takes a bit longer to figure out that you already bought the app. Any additional order will automatically be refunded by Google, you will receive the money back.</b><br><br>\u2605\u2605\u2605 DISCLAIMER:  \u2605\u2605\u2605 <br> The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b>Other FAQ find here:</b><br>https://richface.watch/faq<br><br>!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! <br>richface.watch@gmail.com<br><br>\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained<br>https://www.richface.watch/privacy",
